---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact Us"
  description="Contact CodesCompiler for questions, corrections, feedback, and website inquiries."
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white shadow-sm my-8 rounded-lg">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 text-center">Contact Us</h1>
    <p class="text-center text-gray-600 mb-10">
      We welcome questions, feedback, correction suggestions, and general inquiries about CodesCompiler.
    </p>

    <div class="prose prose-brand prose-lg max-w-none">
      <h2>Email</h2>
      <p>
        The easiest way to contact us is by email:
        <a href="mailto:contact@codescompiler.com"><strong>contact@codescompiler.com</strong></a>
      </p>

      <h2>What You Can Contact Us About</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Questions or feedback about tutorials and articles.</li>
        <li>Corrections to technical content or broken links.</li>
        <li>Questions about CodesCompiler tools and learning resources.</li>
        <li>Website, privacy, cookie, or advertising inquiries.</li>
        <li>General suggestions for improving the site.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Before Sending a Correction</h2>
      <p>
        Please include the page URL and briefly explain the issue. For code-related issues,
        including the relevant code or error message can help us investigate more quickly.
      </p>

      <h2>Response Time</h2>
      <p>
        We review messages as time permits. Sending complete information in your first message
        helps us understand and respond to your request.
      </p>

      <div class="not-prose mt-8 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-6 text-center">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-3">Email CodesCompiler</p>
        <a
          href="mailto:contact@codescompiler.com"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[#ffc400] px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:bg-[#eab000] transition-colors"
        >
          contact@codescompiler.com
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
